    <briefdescription>
<para>Circular reference detection scenario for process linker. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Input:</bold> Processes that trigger each other in a cycle (A→B→A) <linebreak/>
 <bold>Expected Behavior:</bold> Allowed and detected; documented as non-deterministic <linebreak/>
 <bold>Trigger:</bold> Warning log; no error code <linebreak/>
 <bold>Success Criteria:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Links are created successfully (no error)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Circular reference is logged as warning</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No deadlock or infinite loop</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Subprocess execution order documented as non-deterministic </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
